From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Smith <ken@design-nex.us>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 22:28:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] output: add virtual region partitioning

Splits an output's pixel width into one to three adjacent regions from a
list of proportions, with every boundary on a whole logical pixel at the
output's scale, so the regions cover the output with no gaps or overlap.
---
